    "classification": "ABSENT LINK, category 1, CANCELLED BY GEOMETRY, and structural rather than specific to this cell. C1's only read is the ordering index at hybrid_arm.py:317, fed by the value field written at :260 (dashcam) and :311-312 (recall and SS). Dashcam items carry ONE constant value and ONE constant work, so the index is a monotone function of slack and slack is monotone in the deadline: C1's dashcam order is IDENTICALLY EDF order. Every recall item is kept unconditionally by _cap_dashcam_only (:436-437), so C1's placement of robot and SS items reaches only the emitted action sequence, the `order` channel this project already records as unexpressible. CONSEQUENCE: the value / quality table has no other read, so D143 ruling A cannot move a decision in hybrid-F. See proof 4.",
